sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Kubernetes
  participant P as Pod
  participant L as Load balancer
  participant DB as Postgres

  K->>P: SIGTERM
  P->>P: readiness probe starts failing
  P->>L: removed from rotation
  Note over P: stop ACCEPTING; keep SERVING
  loop in-flight runs
    P->>DB: reach a superstep boundary, checkpoint
  end
  P->>DB: close pools
  P-->>K: exit 0
  Note over K,P: grace period must exceed the longest run.<br/>If it does not, this whole sequence is decorative.

  rect rgb(251, 233, 233)
    Note over P: ONE swallowed CancelledError anywhere in<br/>the request path turns this into a 30-second<br/>wait followed by SIGKILL, with work lost.
  end
